  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": 1,
      "sanskrit": "भीष्म उवाच।\n              ततो गते शाकुनिके कपोती प्राह दुःखिता । संस्मृत्य सा च भर्तारं रुदतो शोककर्शिता ॥१॥",
      "english": "Yudhishthira said How was Shuka the son of Vyasa, in days of yore, won over to Renunciation? I wish to hear you recite the story. My curiosity about it is irrepressible.",
      "bhavadeepa": null,
      "chapter": 148,
